{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-51","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：二项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"To find the fourth binomial straight line.","book":10,"number":51,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.51","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.51/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":51,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","contentId":"euclid-10-51","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9403ea2e66f05b9556dd61a56178daf2ba3b95a93e208a2c9ceb9604f70a6640","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-51.statement","euclid-10-51.construction.1","euclid-10-51.construction.2","euclid-10-51.construction.3","euclid-10-51.proof.1","euclid-10-51.proof.2","euclid-10-51.proof.3","euclid-10-51.proof.4","euclid-10-51.construction.4","euclid-10-51.proof.5","euclid-10-51.proof.6","euclid-10-51.proof.7","euclid-10-51.conclusion","euclid-10-51.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-51.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9af1cad25ef3a95b46a262f3c6359016ea5c004727ecc6095fa6f561ff258f20","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the fourth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第四条二项无理线段直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3da7f5e9e4019c9ecd5f2e10cdb3482048415016c3063c1972f884889f7eb46b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers AC, CB be set out such that AB neither has to BC, nor yet to AC, the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC,CB数字,AB数字,即平方数数字至平方数数字,不能达到BC,也不能达到AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4cd6ace766fa748176ddd55681e1a33507af88b86357659a55f0e2b58f2b601b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line D be set out, and let EF be commensurable in length with D; therefore EF is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"准备有理线段、D让EF是长度可公度和D;因此,EF也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fdaf7e5af960ae661996d9072c3329189b8e80fdebe797dec1939681d56462a0","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as the number BA is to AC, so is the square on EF to the square on FG; [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the square on EF is commensurable with the square on FG; [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore FG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设BA对AC的比等于EF对FG对正方形的比;因此,EF对正方形对可公度对正方形的比等于FG对正方形的比;因此,FG对正方形对可公度的比也是正方形;因此,FG对有理的比也是有理。 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c1f64c30dbe7e901de8790ea47ab581d269c49da9d2adfa8622019c1af5ff7e","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since BA has not to AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number, neither has the square on EF to the square on FG the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore EF is incommensurable in length with FG. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于BA的比例尚未达到AC的比例,平方数的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例,EF的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例,FG的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例；上述对应量不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b35a9fc8d727a71c94a7b41da5764e6a252d778adacdfc689a7f79fac5fe4f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF, FG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; so that EG is binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF,FG是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;EG是二项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"482b0e5d9eba1ac02f84c40ae4b6f0938b49d5d6aa519955ddbea41a847c0576","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a fourth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第四条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a33764e5f3f15c1186fe041d733fcea4b698c942a07fa65d21b0f4f85d452c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as BA is to AC, so is the square on EF to the square on FG, therefore the square on EF is greater than the square on FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA比AC等于EF比正方形,FG比正方形,因此EF比正方形大于FG"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"941e261b436fc95212857771fdd4c431eda93939d296fef1f5e67b4866d60f56","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then the squares on FG, H be equal to the square on EF; therefore, convertendo, as the number AB is to BC, so is the square on EF to the square on H. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG,H,正方形等于EF,正方形;因此,转换后,AB-BC的比等于EF,正方形对正方形的比。 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abd3c357ee338007c169003782216139d42421e7599982ffc354721c0dde20b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB has not to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on EF to the square on H the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB的比例没有达到平方数的比例,达到平方数的比例,达到平方数的比例;因此,EF的比例为正方形,而H的比例为正方形,达到平方数的比例为平方数。（相关点与线段：BC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4eb03406a4cf03dfeee27bf6043cd8576b8f380cd19dd651364ff5a927dea4f","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF is incommensurable in length with H; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] therefore the square on EF is greater than the square on GF by the square on a straight line incommensurable with EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF的长度为不可公度,H的长度为EF,因此,EF的长度比GF的正方形长,比不可公度的直线不可公度和EF的正方形大。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3e1374993e46c404bdf1660af0d40af46275dd23d2f32a6387a1a6d02197880","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EF, FG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and EF is commensurable in length with D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF,FG是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,EF是长度可公度,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0252dfe57a2a862a9b9b8477f834bf4e95a279091c280d1b510d05385985492c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EG is a fourth binomial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EG是第四条二项无理线段直线,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-51.source","contentId":"euclid-10-51","revisionId":"euclid-10-51@raw-9403ea2e66f05b95","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d658b7844e5cb332fea51f3a5616d72ce9380670709d48abcd6d518b3b55d799","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.51/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.51\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-51:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-51","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-51.construction.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.51","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.51/","sourceLabel":"X. 6, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-51:euclid-10-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-51","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-51.proof.1","euclid-10-51.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.51","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.51/","sour